        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Instead of chain links, this <em>+3 greater resilient chain shirt</em> is assembled from metal \"leaves\" that each resemble a small blade.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a <em>+3 greater striking dagger</em>. The dagger disappears and reappears as a link in the armor after you Strike with it, or at the end of this turn if you don't make a Strike. You can Activate the <em>blade byrnie</em> in place of an Interact action to draw a weapon for abilities such as the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Draw] feat.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: Blade Byrnie]</p>"
